ion on those criteria for Candidate A. According to rules: If you do not have information, say so directly. Also can mention related observations: anticipation of dangerous situations suggests situational awareness, but not directly reliability or stress resilience. But we must not infer negative evidence. So answer: we have no explicit observations on operational reliability or stress resilience for Candidate A. Provide that."}
